messages.content:
Write one concrete everyday story whose ordered changes match the supplied abstract action sequence.
You are not given a formal proof, identifiers, or formal tactics. Do not invent or mention any.
Use exactly the harness-assigned canonical domain. Write one initial_state and one transition per supplied action.
Each transition contains only the action and its resulting state; never repeat the preceding state. Domain fields must not mention Lean, proofs,
tactics, logic, mathematics, propositions, conjunction, disjunction, or implication.

Example for two abstract actions, “commit to the right available choice” then
“finish using something already in hand”:
{
  "domain": "travel",
  "initial_state": "a traveler holding a blue ticket faces a red lane and a blue lane",
  "transitions": [
    {
      "domain_transition": "the traveler enters the blue lane on the right",
      "domain_after": "the traveler stands at the blue-lane checkpoint"
    },
    {
      "domain_transition": "the traveler presents the blue ticket already in hand",
      "domain_after": "the checkpoint opens"
    }
  ],
  "abandoned_domains": []
}
Return strict JSON only in exactly this shape:
{
  "domain": "one-line domain",
  "initial_state": "one-line initial domain state",
  "transitions": [
    {
      "domain_transition": "one-line domain action",
      "domain_after": "one-line resulting domain state"
    }
  ],
  "abandoned_domains": []
}

